<article class=3D"card full">
<span class=3D"tag">Skill 5</span>
<h3>Independent Learning, Organisation and Digital Skills</h3>
<p><span class=3D"activity">Main evidence: Coursework preparation and this =
ESL webpage</span></p>
<p>I researched presentation topics, prepared scripts and slides, practised=
 independently and completed this digital skills log. Balancing university =
work with employment and personal responsibilities required planning and ti=
me management. I also used digital platforms to prepare, organise and prese=
nt my work. This experience showed me the importance of starting early, che=
cking requirements and keeping evidence organised.</p>
</article>

</div>
</div>
