<div class=3D"activity-box"><strong>Show and Tell =E2=80=93 Rival Boxing Gl=
oves</strong><br>Evidence of confidence, audience engagement, organisation =
and clear spoken communication.</div>
<div class=3D"activity-box"><strong>Group Debate</strong><br>Evidence of te=
amwork, listening, collaboration, argument development and critical thinkin=
g.</div>
<div class=3D"activity-box"><strong>Employability Quiz =E2=80=93 75/100</st=
rong><br>Evidence of independent learning, digital participation, knowledge=
 application and problem solving.</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section id=3D"reflection" class=3D"reflection">
<div class=3D"wrap">
<h2>Reflective Summary</h2>
<div class=3D"reflection-box">
<p>During this module, I developed employability skills through presentatio=
ns, a group debate, an employability quiz and independent coursework. The E=
verlast presentation improved my verbal communication and helped me explain=
 marketing ideas clearly. My Show and Tell about Rival boxing gloves increa=
sed my confidence because I presented a subject that is personally importan=
t to me. The group debate taught me how to listen, divide responsibilities =
and work towards a shared conclusion. Achieving 75 out of 100 in the quiz s=
howed that independent preparation helped me understand the module, while a=
lso identifying areas for improvement. Creating this webpage developed my o=
rganisation and digital skills. In future assessments, I will begin prepari=
ng earlier, keep evidence from every activity and practise presentations se=
veral times before delivering them. I will also ask for feedback and contri=
bute more actively during group preparation. These skills will support my a=
cademic progress and help me communicate, cooperate and make informed decis=
ions in future business roles.</p>
</div>
</div>
